@startuml screenflow-browse
' Spec 005 — screen flow. Each state is a screen (key elements listed); each arrow is a user action.
' Every user story US-005-1..11 is a path through this diagram (see table in spec.md).

hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor white
  BackgroundColor<<public>> #f8fafc
  BackgroundColor<<email>> #fef3c7
  BackgroundColor<<other>> #e0e7ff
  BackgroundColor<<outside>> #dcfce7
  BorderColor #94a3b8
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam arrowFontSize 11

title Spec 005 — screen flow (375 px, Visitor; the Employer and the Admin appear where they reach a public page)

state "Outside jairojobs" as Outside <<outside>>
Outside : a search engine result
Outside : a link shared in a chat, with its preview:
Outside : "Barista (full-time) — Kape Isla"
Outside : "₱14,000–16,000 / month · Matina, Davao City"

state "Drawer (☰)" as Drawer <<public>>
Drawer : Visitor: Browse jobs · Sign up · Log in
Drawer : Candidate, Employer, Admin: Browse jobs · (their own items)

state "Jobs (home, all regions)" as All
All : region choices: ● All regions · Cebu · Davao City · Metro Manila
All : search field ________  [ Search ]
All : type: Any type ▾
All : "142 jobs · newest first"
All : Barista (full-time)
All : Kape Isla · Matina, Davao City
All : ₱14,000–16,000/mo · 2 h ago · ✓ Approved
All : 20 rows at a time · [ Show more ]
All : (none yet) "No jobs are listed yet."
All : (search finds nothing) "No jobs match your search." · Clear search
All : "Every listing shows salary and is checked by jairojobs before it is published."

state "Jobs in a region" as Region
Region : region choices: All regions · Cebu · ● Davao City · Metro Manila
Region : search field ________  [ Search ]
Region : type: Any type ▾
Region : "38 jobs in Davao City · newest first"
Region : Barista (full-time)
Region : Kape Isla · Matina
Region : ₱14,000–16,000/mo · 2 h ago · ✓ Approved
Region : 20 rows at a time · [ Show more ]
Region : (none yet) "No jobs are listed in Davao City yet." · See all regions
Region : (search finds nothing) "No jobs match your search." · Clear search
Region : (a hidden region opens by its address, with no region choice marked)
Region : the same footer line

state "Listing (public page)" as Listing
Listing : ← Jobs in Davao City
Listing : Barista (full-time)
Listing : Kape Isla
Listing : ✓ Approved · Posted 2 h ago · Davao City
Listing : facts box: Salary ₱14,000–16,000 / month ·
Listing : Location Matina, Davao City · Type · Schedule
Listing : About the job · Requirements · Benefits · About Kape Isla
Listing : [ Share ]
Listing : "Applying through jairojobs is coming soon."
Listing : owner only: "This is your listing." · Manage this listing
Listing : Admin only: Open the Admin view (an Admin who owns it sees both)

state "No longer listed" as Gone
Gone : "This job is no longer listed."
Gone : See jobs in Davao City
Gone : (nothing from the listing is shown)
Gone : owner only: Manage this listing
Gone : Admin only: Open the Admin view

state "Not found" as NotFound
NotFound : the usual "not found" page

state "The phone's share sheet" as Sheet <<outside>>
Sheet : the listing's title and address,
Sheet : ready to send in any app
Sheet : (where there is no share sheet:
Sheet : the address is copied, "Link copied")

state "Email to the Employer (spec 004)" as Mail <<email>>
Mail : Your listing is published
Mail : link → the public page
Mail : link → the listing in My listings

state "Employer: Listing (owner view, spec 003)" as Owner <<other>>
Owner : Published: See the public page
Owner : [ Close listing ]

state "Admin: Listing (Admin view, spec 004)" as Admin <<other>>
Admin : Published: See the public page
Admin : [ Take down ] [ Edit ]

[*] --> All : opens jairojobs.com
Drawer --> All : Browse jobs
All --> Region : choose a region
Region --> Region : choose another region
Region --> All : All regions
All --> All : search, choose a type,\nclear, show more
Region --> Region : search, choose a type,\nclear, show more
All --> Listing : tap a row
Region --> Listing : tap a row
Listing --> Region : ← Jobs in Davao City
Listing --> Sheet : Share
Sheet -[dotted]-> Outside : sent to a friend
Outside --> Listing : follows the link\n(the listing is Published)
Outside --> Gone : follows the link\n(the listing was closed or taken down)
Outside --> Listing : follows an address from before the\nlisting moved region → forwarded
Outside --> NotFound : an address that never was a public listing\n(or one built from a listing's id)
Outside --> Region : follows a region's address\n(unknown region → Not found)
Gone --> Region : See jobs in Davao City

Admin -[dotted]-> Mail : on approve (004)\n(not when the listing is the Admin's own)
Mail --> Listing : employer follows the public link
Mail --> Owner : employer follows the My listings link\n(logs in if needed)
Listing --> Owner : Manage this listing\n(owner, logged in)
Owner --> Listing : See the public page
Listing --> Admin : Open the Admin view\n(Admin, logged in)
Admin --> Listing : See the public page
Gone --> Owner : Manage this listing
Gone --> Admin : Open the Admin view

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | white | a public screen, no account needed |
  | light grey | shared navigation |
  | amber | an email, not a screen |
  | blue | a screen from an earlier spec, behind log-in |
  | green | outside jairojobs |
  | dotted arrow | not a tap: sent by the app, or happens outside it |
  | ● | the region choice that is selected |
  | [ brackets ] | a button |
endlegend
@enduml
